OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 31 JAN
OL,4,G0600FSounds of the 60s with Tony
OL,5,     FBlackburn
OL,6,     GTony Blackburn brings you two
OL,7,     Ghours of jam-packed hits from the
OL,8,     G1960s, including The Beach Boys,
OL,9,     GCat Stevens and The Rolling
OL,10,     GStones. Featuring the top three
OL,11,     Gsingles from 1967.
OL,12,G0800FDermot O'Leary
OL,13,     GAdolescence writer Jack Thorne
OL,14,     Gjoins Dermot to chat about his
OL,15,     Gnew adaptation of Lord of the
OL,16,     GFlies. Plus some classic vinyl, a
OL,17,     Gwedding call and The Mystery
OL,18,     GVoice.
